# Criterion 8: revoking network capabilities gives ERR_ACCESS_DENIED through the facade
# Run: bash scripts/gate-tsx.sh tests/core-app.tsx tests/core.test.tsx (from packages/nsh-firebase)
# nsh.json declares capabilities.network hosts [127.0.0.1] and capabilities.host [firebase.*].
# The deny test fetches https://denied.example.test/.json (undeclared network host) and the
# ping-denied/post-denied buttons call other.ping/other.post (names capabilities.host does not grant);
# the stub route must never answer and the runtime must refuse before any handler is reached.
# Test 3 also asserts app.host.posts() actually received the firebase.core.track post.

